{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outlet of any real skoof is a summer cottage! Away from worries, work, and dumb colleagues and bosses. This is a real summer cottage simulator where there is no place for a vegetable garden. Skoof songs on the radio, alcoholic drinks and absolute freedom are exactly what a real skoof needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can chop firewood and light a sauna to have a good steam or dry mushrooms, or you can run through the woods all night on your old penny and listen to your favorite music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skoof has no purpose! You decide exactly how to spend your time in the country.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u041f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043e\u0442\u0434\u044b\u0445","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031500/d560f6e00833c6d0d4af8ee128c6f0ac2aaea477.jpg"},{"name":"\u0417\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0451\u0442\u0441\u044f? \u041d\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u043d\u043e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031500/d560f6e00833c6d0d4af8ee128c6f0ac2aaea477.jpg"},{"name":"\u041e\u043f\u044b\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0441\u043a\u0443\u0444","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031500/d560f6e00833c6d0d4af8ee128c6f0ac2aaea477.jpg"},{"name":"\u041d\u0430\u0434\u0435\u044e\u0441\u044c \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0435\u0441\u0451\u0442","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031500/d560f6e00833c6d0d4af8ee128c6f0ac2aaea477.jpg"},{"name":"\u041f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437\u0432\u043e\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0437\u0436\u0435","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4031500/d560f6e00833c6d0d4af8ee128c6f0ac2aaea477.jpg"},{"name":"\u0417\u0430\u043f\u0430\u0441\u044b \u043d\u0430 \u0437\u0438\u043c\u0443","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit